     "p": {
      "ar": "`/vat/{amount}` → `amount` من المسار، وأي معامل تاني في الدالة مش في المسار بيبقى query (`?rate=0.2`). الـ type hint (`float` و`int`) بيحوّل ويتحقق لوحده: `/vat/abc` بيرجّع 422 برسالة واضحة من غير ما تكتب سطر تحقق. والقيمة اللي بترجّعها (dict أو list) بتتحول JSON لوحدها.",
      "en": "`/vat/{amount}` → `amount` comes from the path, and any other function parameter not in the path becomes a query (`?rate=0.2`). The type hint (`float`, `int`) converts and validates by itself: `/vat/abc` returns 422 with a clear message without you writing a check. Whatever you return (a dict or list) becomes JSON automatically."
     },
     "ex": "from fastapi import FastAPI\nfrom fastapi.testclient import TestClient\n\napp = FastAPI()\n\n@app.get(\"/vat/{amount}\")\ndef vat(amount: float, rate: float = 0.14):\n    return {\"total\": round(amount * (1 + rate), 2)}\n\n# TestClient calls the app without starting a server — perfect for trying and testing\nclient = TestClient(app)\nprint(client.get(\"/vat/100\").json())\nprint(client.get(\"/vat/100?rate=0.2\").json())\nr = client.get(\"/vat/abc\")\nprint(r.status_code, r.json()[\"detail\"][0][\"msg\"])"
