     "h": {
      "ar": "مفتاح API بـ dependency",
      "en": "An API key through a dependency"
     },
     "p": {
      "ar": "أي API على النت لازم يتحمى. اعمل دالة `require_key` بتقرا header `X-API-Key` وتقارنه بالمفتاح من .env (بـ `secrets.compare_digest`)، وتطلّع 401 لو غلط. `Depends(require_key)` على الـ endpoints (أو الـ router كله) بيشغّلها قبل كل طلب. في n8n: HTTP Request → Authentication → Header Auth بنفس الاسم والقيمة.",
      "en": "Any API on the internet must be protected. Write `require_key`, which reads the `X-API-Key` header, compares it with the key from .env (with `secrets.compare_digest`) and raises 401 when wrong. `Depends(require_key)` on the endpoints (or the whole router) runs it before every request. In n8n: HTTP Request → Authentication → Header Auth with the same name and value."
     },
     "ex": "import os, secrets\nfrom fastapi import Depends, FastAPI, Header, HTTPException\nfrom fastapi.testclient import TestClient\n\nos.environ.setdefault(\"TOOLS_API_KEY\", \"demo-key-for-tests\")\n\ndef require_key(x_api_key: str = Header(default=\"\")):\n    if not secrets.compare_digest(x_api_key, os.environ[\"TOOLS_API_KEY\"]):\n        raise HTTPException(401, detail=\"missing or wrong X-API-Key\")\n\napp = FastAPI(dependencies=[Depends(require_key)])   # every endpoint is protected\n\n@app.get(\"/stats\")\ndef stats():\n    return {\"orders\": 85}\n\nc = TestClient(app)\nprint(c.get(\"/stats\").status_code)\nprint(c.get(\"/stats\", headers={\"X-API-Key\": \"demo-key-for-tests\"}).json())"
